                                                    rdfs:label "metric.performance.tb"@en .


###  https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb.request
<https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb.request> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                            rdfs:subClassOf <https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb> ;
                                                            rdfs:comment "These metrics correspond to request and time behavior. A request can represent a job, a function call, an HTTP request, or a database transaction."@en ;
                                                            rdfs:label "metric.performance.tb.request"@en .


###  https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb.request.blocked_time
