                                                                         rdfs:label "metric.performance.tb.request.sending_time"@en .


###  https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb.response
<https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb.response> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                             rdfs:subClassOf <https://ai-square.ch/ai2apm#metric.performance.tb> ;
